tokens.css, glass.css: saltglass, cut to the tokens and the six classes page.html uses
  (gl-glass-bar, gl-bar-top, gl-tabbar, gl-tab, gl-action, gl-btn). saltglass is saltFlow's design system, under
  saltFlow's licence. To refresh: copy both files from saltglass and cut them the same way.
saltflow.css: saltFlow's own layer over saltglass (the page's frame, panels, lists, sheets). Not vendored; edit here.
server.py inlines the three into page.html's placeholders in this order: tokens, glass, saltflow.
